    "text": "The Los Angeles Dodgers open a home series against the struggling New York Mets, looking to extend their strong early-season form.MORE: Top 10 pitchers who delivered in 2026 MLB debutsDate: Monday, April 13, 2026Time: 10:10 PM ETChannel: SportsNet Los Angeles / SportsNet New York / MLB.TVAdvertisementLos Angeles enters this matchup at 11-4, one of the best starts in the league, and has been dominant offensively, especially at home, where they’re 6-3 and undefeated (8-0) when scoring five or more runs. The lineup is loaded, with Shohei Ohtani already showing elite two-way impact early in the season and the Dodgers ranking among the league’s best against left-handed pitching, a key factor with Mets starter David Peterson on the mound. Even with a recent series loss to Texas, this is still a team with championship-level depth and momentum heading into this series.– Live Stream Dodgers vs Mets –New York, meanwhile, comes in at 7-9 and in the middle of a five-game losing streak, including a sweep by the Athletics, where they managed just nine total runs across those five games. Injuries have played a role, most notably Juan Soto being sidelined, and the offense has struggled to produce consistently despite solid individual flashes from players like Francisco Alvarez (4 HR) and Luis Robert Jr. hitting over .300. With the Mets calling up veteran Tommy Pham for a spark, this series becomes a major early-season test against one of MLB’s top contenders.Live stream Dodgers vs Mets on Fubo: Start your subscription now!AdvertisementWith Fubo, you can watch live television without cable on your phone, TV, or tablet. Fubo carries a wide array of sports and entertainment channels, including local sports packages and top national channels like ABC, FOX, CBS, ESPN, FS1, MTV, Comedy Central, and much more. The best part is you can try it out today for free.Regional restrictions may apply. If you purchase a product or register for an account through one of the links on our